description=Loader layer for ZombieBuddy Java mods, by Dont39: at game start it opens up the game and mod internals that installed mods list, and keeps mods that need it loading at game start; it runs the hooks of mods built on it while they are in the mod list. Does nothing on its own; other mods require it.
